        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mwana w’umuntu, Tiro ko havuze hitamba kuri Yerusalemu ngw Awa! ngw Icār’ umwugariro w’amahanga kirahomvotse! ngo Biransenyukiyeko, ngiye gutunga, co ko gicitse imisaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuko rero, uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Nzohigūra nawe, ewe Tiro; nzokuvyukiriza amahanga menshi, nk’ukw ikiyaga kivyutsa imipfunda yaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bo bazosangangura inzitiro z’i Tiro, bahomvore iminara yaho: nanje umukungugu waho nzowukukumba, mpahindure urutare rugaragara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazosigara ar’ aho kwanikira insenga hagati mu kiyaga; ni jewe mbivuze, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize; hazoba inyagano y’amahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’abakobga baho bari mu misozi bazoririkwa n’inkota: maze bazomenya yuko jewe nd’ Uhoraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
