        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Rāba, ngira ngomorere i Tiro Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babuloni, umwami w’abami; azoza aturutse i burārūko, afise amafarasi n’imikogote ikwegwa na yo, n’abagendera ku mafarasi, n’ingabo z’abantu benshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.21.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 21:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakobga bawe bari mu misozi azobaririkisha inkota: kand’ azokwubaka ibihome vyo kugutera, akurundire ibigunguzi vyo kwuririrako, kand’ azokugwako yitwaje inkinzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzitiro zawe z’amabuye azozihirikakw ibiti vy’ imigogo vyo kuzihomvora, n’iminara yawe abihomvoze incabiti ziwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kukw amafarasi yiwe ari menshi, umukungugu azosūra uzokuyoberanya: inzitiro zawe zizonyiganyizwa n’akariri k’abagendera ku mafarasi, n’ak’ imikogote itwara ibintu n’ak’ imikogote y’intambara, igihe azofyuka mu marembo yawe, nk’ukw abantu bitera mu gisagara giciwe ikirengero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azotakangisha inzira zawe zose inzāra z’amafarasi yiwe: abantu bawe azobaririkisha inkota, kand’ inkingi zanditswekw ivy’ ubutōre bgawe zizotsindwa hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.27.12+EZK.27.13+EZK.27.14+EZK.27.15+EZK.27.16+EZK.27.17+EZK.27.18+EZK.27.19+EZK.27.20+EZK.27.21+EZK.27.22+EZK.27.23+EZK.27.24"
              },
              "items": [
