        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho abaza Tiro, ati Mbeg’ ababa ku kiyaga ntibazoshirwa mu gatengo no kwumva ugusenyerana kwawe, igihe abakomeretse bazoba baniha, habaye gusasikwa hagati muri wewe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
