          "text": "Kandi bazocura intimba bakuririra, bakubgire, bat’ Ewe kuntu ugeseye, wewe wahora ubābgamwo n’abagenda uruja n’uruza mu kiyaga, war’ igisagara rurangiranwa, kandi war’ agakomeye ku kiyaga, mwe n’abākubamwo, abāhora bateye ubgoba ababa ku kiyaga nyene! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
