        },
        {
          "text": "Noneh’ ababa kuri co bazohinda agashitsi ku musi w’ugusenyerana kwawe; mber’ ibizinga vyo mu kiyaga bizohagarikwa umutima n’uk’ uherengeteye.",
          "type": "text",
